Attribution Statement:
This dataset integrates public sector geospatial boundaries from the Survey Department of Sri Lanka and United Nations Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs (UN OCHA, COD-AB Level 3), and atmospheric reanalysis models from the Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring Service (CAMS) via the Open-Meteo API.
